<title>USA: CapStar Hotel Co Q3 shr proforma increases.</title>
<headline>CapStar Hotel Co Q3 shr proforma increases.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>-PRO FORMA-</p>
<p>Three Months Ended Sept. 30,  Nine Months Ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>		   1996	     1995	  1996	    1995</p>
<p>Total Revenue</p>
<p>	    32,069,378     30,227,865  92,215,501    86,584,933</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>	     3,557,124	2,000,858   7,035,066     4,487,598</p>
<p>Earnings Per</p>
<p>  Share	   0.28	     0.16	  0.55	    0.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Pro forma results assume CapStar's initial public offering and the acquisition of its 12 owned hotels had occurred at the beginning of the periods presented.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
